DESCRIPTION:National Margarita Day falls on February 22 and lives almost en
 tirely in bars and restaurants\, in specials priced to the date and frozen
 -machine promotions. Britannica dates the observance itself to 2008 but na
 mes no founder. The drink behind it has an origin even less settled: at le
 ast seven people have been credited with inventing the margarita\, and the
  evidence decisively favors none of them.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/h
 oliday/national-margarita-day/
